WEBVTT

01:06:59.077 --> 01:07:00.418
Thank you so much.

01:07:00.442 --> 01:07:03.235
If people want to keep up with you,

01:07:03.259 --> 01:07:05.974
first of all, they can follow you
on Twitter, for example.

01:07:05.998 --> 01:07:07.347
What's your Twitter handle?

01:07:07.371 --> 01:07:09.990
AK: So @AdamJKucharski, all one word.

01:07:10.014 --> 01:07:12.524
CA: Adam, thank you so much
for your time, stay well.

01:07:12.548 --> 01:07:13.928
AK: Thank you.

01:07:13.952 --> 01:07:20.952
(Music)

01:07:29.263 --> 01:07:32.533
CA: Associate professor
and TED Fellow Adam Kucharski.